{"id":"fortuna","lemma":"fortuna","pos":"noun","rank":1417,"glosses":["fortune","fortune, prophecy, reading","wealth"],"ipa":"/foɾˈtuna/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fortunas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-fortuna.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi tío hizo una fortuna.","en":"My uncle made a fortune.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39630","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"uncle"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Mi abuela nos dejó una gran fortuna.","en":"My grandmother left us a great fortune.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705189","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"grandmother"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"Por fortuna no murió nadie.","en":"Luckily nobody died.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449689","words":[{"g":"for / by"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"no one"}]},{"text":"Perdió una fortuna en la bolsa.","en":"He lost a fortune in the stock market.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689151","words":[{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bag"}]},{"text":"Él hizo una gran fortuna durante su vida.","en":"He made a great fortune in his lifetime.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706432","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"during, in, over"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"life"}]}]}